    You can negate that effect, then if you control a Synchro Monster, you can destroy
    that card. You can only use this effect of "Elfnotes: Aristeia of Trust" once
    per turn. You cannot activate these effects of "Elfnotes: Aristeia of Trust"
    in the same Chain.'
